{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"water-intake-calculator UI copy.fields.scopeNote","detected_language":"no","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"water-intake-calculator.copy.fields.scopeNote","keys":["water-intake-calculator.copy.fields.scopeNote"],"locale":"nb-NO","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"National Academies-referansen er ZXQPH0000QXZ L/dag for kvinner og ZXQPH0001QXZ L/dag for menn i alderen ZXQPH0002QXZ–ZXQPH0003QXZ.Den teller vann i mat, drikke og drikkevann.Dette er tilstrekkelige inntaksverdier for befolkningen, ikke personlige resepter eller minimum for hver person.","record_id":"802f6f184be6710042143b2df29665de4cc7d49d48c48d525c7a311f55d72444","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":2.482202063499983,"source":"The National Academies reference is 2.7 L/day for women and 3.7 L/day for men ages 19–30. It counts water in food, beverages and drinking water. These are population Adequate Intake values, not personal prescriptions or minimums for every person.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"7b939749614832bcc4076d341ddfbea83bd4ababacec1c3b510f56749ad20ea4","status":"machine-draft","translation":"National Academies-referansen er 2.7 L/dag for kvinner og 3.7 L/dag for menn i alderen 19–30.Den teller vann i mat, drikke og drikkevann.Dette er tilstrekkelige inntaksverdier for befolkningen, ikke personlige resepter eller minimum for hver person.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
